                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Judging by the developer name I would assume that this was made as a college project so bear that in mind going forward. \n\nThe game is a blast, Though it has a severe lack of content with only 3 weapons and 1 map (2 if you count the tutorial map) At its current stage I feel early access would have been a better choice. \n\nThere are minimal graphics settings. Setting the graphics to \"low\" has little to no difference to setting it to \"epic.\" I was dropping probably 10-20 frames regardless of graphic settings though I was still able to play and win a few games. That being said every game starts with just you and you have to wait for people to join as the timer ticks down. \n\nStill a lot of fun and a lot of potential to become better assuming the devs continue to work on it though considering this appears to be a college project I wouldn't hold my breath.\n\n\nEDIT: Just tried to play a bit this morning and the game locked up my entire pc. I waited for about 10 minutes unable to tab out or CTRL+ALT+DELETE before force restarting my pc. gonna play some more and if this continues to happen I may change my review to not recommended",
